(text "M1: 1.8 deg, 200 full steps/rev, 2.3 A/phase.\nMotor pin 3 unused. Encoder is on sheet 4.\nMotor wiring colours refer to the motor drawing." (at 289.56 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "afcc0d6e-a84e-5b6d-9a09-d594d196cbd2"))
(text "DM542T SETTINGS / INITIAL COMMISSIONING\nS2 signal selector: 5 V.\n1/16 step: SW5 ON, SW6 ON, SW7 OFF, SW8 ON.\n3200 STEP pulses per motor revolution.\nConservative initial current: 2.03 A RMS / 2.84 A peak\nSW1 ON, SW2 ON, SW3 OFF; SW4 OFF (idle reduction).\nCheck the actual V4.0 label before setting switches." (at 193.04 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9e332ada-f778-54d5-be5c-3f860f4a0019"))
(text "SHARED ENABLE AND TIMING\nPE15 low: Q3 off, DM542T enabled, both TMC EN inputs low.\nPE15 high: Q3 on, DM542T disabled, both TMC EN inputs high.\nR7 pulls PE15 high during MCU reset; about 7 mA sink when enabled.\nAfter enable, wait >=200 ms. DIR setup >=5 us; STEP high/low >=2.5 us." (at 20.32 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6927a3be-78de-5928-8afb-53b1a4c1009a"))
(text "Q1-Q3 show functional B/C/E pins, not package lead numbers.\nVerify your 2N2222A manufacturer/package before assembly.\nFit each 10k between base and emitter. Keep PUL+/PUL- paired;\nseparate signal cables from motor power cables." (at 226.06 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8dba707b-2837-58ed-86ba-f9236c000368"))
(embedded_fonts no)
